 "remarks": "Enjoy the best of waterfront living in this beautifully situated end unit in the sough after complex \"Palmer Landing\" in Shippan Point. The spacious, open-concept living and dining areas flow seamlessly together, featuring a wood burning fireplace and direct access to an outdoor deck, creating the perfect setting for both entertaining and everyday living. The well designed kitchen has abundant cabinets and is updated for all of your needs. Both bedrooms offer the luxury and privacy of their own en-suite bathrooms, creating two well-appointed private retreats. The unit has been freshly painted, recent hot water heater, HVAC system and it also comes with a 1 car detached garage.This is a wonderful opportunity to enjoy a desirable location, scenic surroundings, and the ease of condominium living. Don't miss the chance to make this special property your own. Close to Stamford train station, shopping, dining, marinas, gyms, and parks.",
